[00:00.000]...
[00:14.688]She lost her brother a month ago
{"她一个月前失去了哥哥"}
[00:20.468]His picture on the wall
{"墙上的照片"}
[00:23.206]And it reminds me
{"让我想起"}
[00:28.079]When she brings me coffee, her smile
{"当她递来咖啡时的微笑"}
[00:33.881]I wish I could be with her 'til my last day
{"多希望能伴她走到生命尽头"}
[00:41.544]She said she gave all her love to me
{"她说已将全部的爱给了我"}
[00:47.692]We dreamt a new life
{"我们曾憧憬新生活"}
[00:50.360]Some place to be at peace
{"寻找安宁的归宿"}
[00:55.072]But things changed, suddenly
{"但一切骤变"}
[01:00.387]I lost my dreams in this disaster
{"在这场灾难中梦想湮灭"}
[01:07.793]I'm crying
{"我哭泣着"}
[01:09.880]Missing my lover
{"思念我的爱人"}
[01:13.268]I don't have the power
{"我已无力挣扎"}
[01:17.491]On my side forever
{"永远站在我这边"}
[01:21.714]Oh, where is my lover?
{"哦，我的爱人在哪里？"}
[01:26.822]And I got no power I'm standing alone, no way
{"孤立无援 独自伫立 无路可退"}
[01:39.462]Calling out your name
{"呼唤你的名字"}
[01:45.686]...
