[02:21.533]I lost my dreams in this disaster
{"在这场灾难中梦想湮灭"}
[02:28.360]We don't know what is wrong tonight
{"今夜我们不知何处出了错"}
[02:35.164]Everybody's got no place to hide
{"所有人都无处躲藏"}
[02:41.968]No one's left and there's no one to go on
{"无人幸存 也无人能继续前行"}
[02:48.866]All I know is my life is gone
{"我只知道我的生命已逝去"}
[02:55.927]...
